    'mulching-services': {
      bannerTitle: 'Mulching in Montgomery, MA',
      sectTitle: 'Fresh Mulch for Montgomery\'s Garden Beds and Landscapes',
      sectDesc: 'Mulch makes an immediate visual impact on any Montgomery property, and the benefits go far beyond looks. A proper mulch layer suppresses weeds, retains soil moisture through dry summer weeks, and protects plant roots from temperature swings. Trimming Edge provides professional mulch installation for Montgomery homes and businesses, from small residential beds to larger commercial landscapes. We are based right here in Montgomery, so our mulch service comes with fast response times and local knowledge of the town\'s soil and growing conditions. Call (413) 551-9653.',
      section1Heading: 'Bed Preparation for Montgomery Properties',
      section1Body: 'Before applying mulch, we thoroughly prepare your Montgomery garden beds. This means removing weeds, pulling out old annuals, clearing debris, and redefining bed edges for a crisp, clean border. For Montgomery\'s clay-heavy soils, we may recommend adding compost beneath the mulch layer to improve drainage and soil structure. We also assess plant health during prep, flagging any issues that should be addressed before mulching. This preparation step ensures your mulch looks great and performs properly, rather than just covering up problems.',
      section2Heading: 'Quality Mulch Applied with Precision',
      section2Body: 'We use premium shredded hardwood mulch that holds its color well and breaks down at a rate that enriches Montgomery\'s soil without disappearing too quickly. Our application is precise: 2 to 3 inches deep, kept away from plant stems and tree trunks, and spread evenly across the bed surface. For large Montgomery properties with extensive bed areas, we work efficiently with wheelbarrows and rakes. For detailed beds around perennials and delicate plantings, we work by hand to avoid damage. The result is a uniform, professional appearance on every bed.',
      section3Heading: 'Annual Mulch Refresh Programs',
      section3Body: 'Mulch breaks down over time, which is good for soil health but means color fades and depth shrinks. We offer annual mulch refresh programs for Montgomery clients who want their landscape beds looking consistently maintained. Our refresh service adds a thin top-dressing layer to restore color and depth without over-mulching. We also take the opportunity to weed, adjust bed edges, and assess plant health during refresh visits. Annual maintenance keeps your Montgomery property looking polished year after year.',
    },
