      sectTitle: 'Spring and Fall Cleanup for Montgomery Properties',
      sectDesc: 'Montgomery\'s rural setting with mature trees and open spaces means seasonal cleanup is essential for maintaining a healthy, attractive property. Fall brings heavy leaf drop from maples, oaks, and the town\'s many wooded areas. Spring reveals the debris that winter storms and snow cover left behind. Trimming Edge, based right here in Montgomery, provides thorough seasonal cleanup services that prepare your property for each new season. We handle lawns, beds, hard surfaces, and hauling. Call (413) 551-9653 to schedule.',
      section1Heading: 'Fall Cleanup for Montgomery\'s Leaf Season',
      section1Body: 'Montgomery\'s trees produce spectacular fall color — and then they drop those leaves all over your lawn. A thick leaf layer left on grass blocks sunlight, traps moisture, and invites fungal diseases like snow mold. Our fall cleanup service removes leaves from lawns, garden beds, walkways, and driveways. For Montgomery properties with significant tree cover, we offer multiple fall visits to keep up with continuous leaf drop. We also clear fallen branches, cut back perennials, and prepare beds for winter dormancy.',
