      section3Heading: 'Complete Cleanup Including Hauling',
      section3Body: 'Our Montgomery seasonal cleanup includes full debris removal, not just raking and piling. We haul away all collected leaves, branches, and material so your property is clean when we leave. For large branch removal after storms, we handle cutting, chipping, and hauling. For routine leaf cleanup, we compost when possible or haul to proper disposal. Montgomery clients do not have to deal with bagging leaves or figuring out town disposal schedules. We handle the entire process from cleanup to removal.',
